{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\nLog of the selected job from `gh run view <id> --log --job <job-id>`.\n\n## Spec\n- Uses the shared `TailPane` component (from the Docker logs pane): follow mode for in-progress jobs, search, scroll\n- Step headers (`##[group]` / step names) rendered as section lines; a key jumps to the first failed step\n- Logs are already secret-masked by GitHub (`***`); vig does no additional filtering\n\nPart of #98.\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-28T07:14:48Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":102,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Actions: log pane"}
